      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: This dataset includes a method of producing a seperator for a lithium ion battery. The seperator seperates anode from cathode, but allows an exchange of Li+-ions through micropores. In case of to high process temperature of the battery, the seperator melts,  thus  closes the micopores, interrupts the Li+-ion exchange and therefore stops the chemical process and pretends finally from  overheating or a burning battery . </text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
